cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SDA Vision in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "SDA Vision"
abstract: >-
  SDA stands for Synthetic-media Discourse Analysis.
  A research tool for examining AI-generated and traditional media using model interpretations,
  content credentials and local forensic cues. Community Workshop and an illustrated facilitator guide
  support discussion and export, with participant responses kept separate from
  automated findings. The public website uses prepared examples and saved results.
